# The Python build tools of the engine packs. install_build_tools of pack_common.sh installs them with
# `pip install --require-hashes --force-reinstall -r`, so this file lists every tool and what the tool needs. The build
# runs without isolation and uses the setuptools of this file. pefile is not a build tool: the wheel check of the
# mistral.rs pack reads the import tables of the Windows files with it.
# The version of setuptools is in the WHEEL file of each pack, so a new version changes the bytes of every pack.
